hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"26","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Suwaid Al-Nakhai se riwayat hai, hamein Abdul Malik bin Abi Sulaiman ne bataya, Ata se, kehte hain: Main aur Ubaid bin Umair Aisha ke paas dakhil hue. Unho ne Ubaid bin Umair se kaha: Ab waqt ho gaya hai ke tum hamari ziyarat karo. Unho ne kaha: Main kehta hoon Ay Amma! Jaise pehle ne kaha: Ziyarat mein lambe waqt ka darmiyan rakho toh mohabbat barhegi. Unho ne kaha: Apni is rataanat (bak-bak) se hamen choro. Ibn-e-Umair ne kaha: Hamein sab se ajeeb cheez batayi jo aap ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se dekhi ho. Toh woh chup reh gayi phir boli: Jab mein ek raat mein thi, Aap ne farmaya: (Ay Aisha! Mujhe choro, main aaj raat apne Rab ki ibadat karoon). Maine kaha: Wallah! Mujhe aap ki qurbat se mohabbat hai aur us cheez se mohabbat hai jo aap ko khush kare. Boli: Aap khade hue, wuzu farmaya phir namaz ke liye khade ho gaye. Boli: Aap rote rahe yahan tak ke aap ka seenah bheeg gaya. Boli: Phir roye aur rote rahe yahan tak ke daadhi bheeg gayi. Boli: Phir roye aur rote rahe yahan tak ke zameen bheeg gayi. Bilal aaye aur unhein namaz ki azaan kahi. Jab unho ne aap ko rote dekha toh kaha: Ay Rasoolullah! Aap kyon rote hain jabke Allah ne aap ke pichle aur aage ke gunah maaf kar diye? Aap ne farmaya: (Kya main shukar guzar banda na banu? Aaj raat mujh par ek ayat nazil hui. Wail hai us shakhs ke liye jo ise parhe aur is mein ghaur na kare {Inna fi khalqis samawati wal arz} [Aal-e-Imran: 190]) poore ayat ko."
"27","[AI-translation] Awn bin Abi Juhaifa se riwayat hai, Al-Mundhir bin Jarir se, aur unho ne apne walid se, kehte hain: Hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas din ke aaghaz mein the. Kehte hain: Aap ke paas kuch log nange paon, nange badan, nemaar ya aba (chadar) pehne hue, talwarein bandhe hue aaye. In mein se aksar Muzar se the, balke sab Muzar se the. Un mein jo faqa (zaroorat) dekh kar Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka chehra udhaar (surkh) ho gaya. Aap andar gaye phir bahar aaye, Bilal ko hukm diya, unho ne azaan kahi aur iqamat ki, phir namaz padhi phir khutba di. Aap ne farmaya: (Ay logo! Apne Rab se daro jis ne tumhein ek nafs se paida kiya) ayat ke aakhir tak (Yaqeenan Allah tumhara nigehban hai) aur Al-Hashr ki ayat (Allah se daro aur har nafs dekhe ke us ne kal ke liye kya bheja hai, aur Allah se daro). Ek shakhs apne dinar se, dirham se, kapde se, gandum ke saa' se, khajoor ke saa' se sadqa kare - yahan tak ke farmaya - aur agar khajoor ka tukda bhi ho. Kehte hain: Ek Ansaari shakhs ek thaili le kar aaya jise uthane mein us ka haath qareeb tha ke na utha sake, balke us se uthaya hi na ja saka. Kehte hain: Phir log pich-pich aate gaye yahan tak ke main ne gandum aur kapdon ke do dher dekhe, yahan tak ke main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka chehra dekha jo khushi se chamak raha tha jaise sona. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: (Jo shakhs Islam mein koi achi sunnat jari kare, us ke liye us ka ajar hai aur us ke baad us par amal karne walon ka ajar bhi, in ke ajr mein se kuch bhi kam na hoga. Aur jo shakhs Islam mein koi buri sunnat jari kare, us par us ka bojh hai aur us ke baad us par amal karne walon ka bojh bhi, in ke bojh mein se kuch bhi kam na hoga)."
